{"enrichment_id": "ENR_SHL_SONGBEN_0141", "clause_id": "SHL_SONGBEN_0141", "source_id": "SHSRC0033", "chapter": "辨太陽病脈證並治下", "base_sha256": "cc15680ea4d70797341b64401a6d79a66f26c49db8b35d6331c433c04326cdbf", "display_text": "病在陽，應以汗解之，反以冷水潠之，若灌之，其熱被劫，不得去，彌更益煩，肉上粟起，意欲飲水，反不渴者，服文蛤散；若不差者，與五苓散。本條前段參別本加入。寒實結胸，無熱證者，與三物小陷胸湯，白散亦可服考《金匱玉函經》、《千金翼方》均無“陷胸湯”及“亦可服”六字。。", "segments": [{"t": "text", "s": "病在陽，應以汗解之，反以冷水潠之，若灌之，其熱被劫，不得去，彌更益煩，肉上粟起，意欲飲水，反不渴者，服文蛤散；若不差者，與五苓散。"}, {"t": "note", "s": "本條前段參別本加入。"}, {"t": "text", "s": "寒實結胸，無熱證者，與三物小陷胸湯，白散亦可服"}, {"t": "note", "s": "考《金匱玉函經》、《千金翼方》均無“陷胸湯”及“亦可服”六字。"}, {"t": "text", "s": "。"}], "method": "deterministic_markup_parse", "record_kind": "clause_with_collation_notes", "collation_notes": ["本條前段參別本加入。", "考《金匱玉函經》、《千金翼方》均無“陷胸湯”及“亦可服”六字。"]}
{"enrichment_id": "ENR_SHL_SONGBEN_AUX_0004", "clause_id": "SHL_SONGBEN_AUX_0004", "source_id": "SHSRC0035", "chapter": "辨脈法第一", "base_sha256": "23191f0c3b4b68c613b17295cc485548510c7f5815cfbe69e9cc7dcbd59bee37", "display_text": "陽脈浮一作微陰脈弱者，則血虛。血虛則筋急也。", "segments": [{"t": "text", "s": "陽脈浮"}, {"t": "note", "s": "一作微"}, {"t": "text", "s": "陰脈弱者，則血虛。血虛則筋急也。"}], "method": "deterministic_markup_parse", "record_kind": "clause_with_collation_notes", "collation_notes": ["一作微"]}
{"enrichment_id": "ENR_SHL_SONGBEN_AUX_0008", "clause_id": "SHL_SONGBEN_AUX_0008", "source_id": "SHSRC0035", "chapter": "辨脈法第一", "base_sha256": "e3dbf14b5c070b4321e9c7685c47ffdb524b3f94cc691859bcf600c31bd97302", "display_text": "脈一云秋脈藹藹，如車蓋者，名曰陽結也。", "segments": [{"t": "text", "s": "脈"}, {"t": "note", "s": "一云秋脈"}, {"t": "text", "s": "藹藹，如車蓋者，名曰陽結也。"}], "method": "deterministic_markup_parse", "record_kind": "clause_with_collation_notes", "collation_notes": ["一云秋脈"]}
{"enrichment_id": "ENR_SHL_SONGBEN_AUX_0009", "clause_id": "SHL_SONGBEN_AUX_0009", "source_id": "SHSRC0035", "chapter": "辨脈法第一", "base_sha256": "daaef33d14862d4d34f8d680164d1842d3ef06815908a5086c49a45d458f7d59", "display_text": "脈一云夏脈纍纍，如循長竿者，名曰陰結也。", "segments": [{"t": "text", "s": "脈"}, {"t": "note", "s": "一云夏脈"}, {"t": "text", "s": "纍纍，如循長竿者，名曰陰結也。"}], "method": "deterministic_markup_parse", "record_kind": "clause_with_collation_notes", "collation_notes": ["一云夏脈"]}
{"enrichment_id": "ENR_SHL_SONGBEN_AUX_0011", "clause_id": "SHL_SONGBEN_AUX_0011", "source_id": "SHSRC0035", "chapter": "辨脈法第一", "base_sha256": "1b75048dc42d8fe77e0a5ac803deeee5f4b17575014c73d73b727effbd0e6f54", "display_text": "脈縈縈，如蜘蛛絲者，陽氣一云陰氣衰也。", "segments": [{"t": "text", "s": "脈縈縈，如蜘蛛絲者，陽氣"}, {"t": "note", "s": "一云陰氣"}, {"t": "text", "s": "衰也。"}], "method": "deterministic_markup_parse", "record_kind": "clause_with_collation_notes", "collation_notes": ["一云陰氣"]}
{"enrichment_id": "ENR_SHL_SONGBEN_AUX_0013", "clause_id": "SHL_SONGBEN_AUX_0013", "source_id": "SHSRC0035", "chapter": "辨脈法第一", "base_sha256": "40be76f5d6cdea99f2f1937717949f95281718942c677f0b70bde890fedbe416", "display_text": "脈來緩，時一止復來者，名曰結。脈來數，時一止復來者，名曰促一作縱。脈陽盛則促，陰盛則結，此皆病脈。", "segments": [{"t": "text", "s": "脈來緩，時一止復來者，名曰結。脈來數，時一止復來者，名曰促"}, {"t": "note", "s": "一作縱"}, {"t": "text", "s": "。脈陽盛則促，陰盛則結，此皆病脈。"}], "method": "deterministic_markup_parse", "record_kind": "clause_with_collation_notes", "collation_notes": ["一作縱"]}
{"enrichment_id": "ENR_SHL_SONGBEN_AUX_0025", "clause_id": "SHL_SONGBEN_AUX_0025", "source_id": "SHSRC0035", "chapter": "辨脈法第一", "base_sha256": "00d2d5871a5c3589a5ddbeb7ccabe0044d1dd18dc0d522a83e3ce1ecb48d54c4", "display_text": "立夏得洪一作浮大脈，是其本位。其人病身體苦疼重者，須發其汗。若明日身不疼不重者，不須發汗。若汗濈濈自出者，明日便解矣。何以言之？立夏得洪大脈，是其時脈，故使然也。四時倣此。", "segments": [{"t": "text", "s": "立夏得洪"}, {"t": "note", "s": "一作浮"}, {"t": "text", "s": "大脈，是其本位。其人病身體苦疼重者，須發其汗。若明日身不疼不重者，不須發汗。若汗濈濈自出者，明日便解矣。何以言之？立夏得洪大脈，是其時脈，故使然也。四時倣此。"}], "method": "deterministic_markup_parse", "record_kind": "clause_with_collation_notes", "collation_notes": ["一作浮"]}
{"enrichment_id": "ENR_SHL_SONGBEN_AUX_0028", "clause_id": "SHL_SONGBEN_AUX_0028", "source_id": "SHSRC0035", "chapter": "辨脈法第一", "base_sha256": "e73dde6279a78da9348b723505a05b6819f3c3dcd574b258b2e3c661ebbc3189", "display_text": "趺陽脈浮而濇，少陰脈如經也，其病在脾，法當下利。何以知之？若脈浮大者，氣實血虛也。今趺陽脈浮而濇，故知脾氣不足，胃氣虛也。以少陰脈弦而浮一作沉，才見此為調脈，故稱如經也。若反滑而數者，故知當屎膿也。", "segments": [{"t": "text", "s": "趺陽脈浮而濇，少陰脈如經也，其病在脾，法當下利。何以知之？若脈浮大者，氣實血虛也。今趺陽脈浮而濇，故知脾氣不足，胃氣虛也。以少陰脈弦而浮"}, {"t": "note", "s": "一作沉"}, {"t": "text", "s": "，才見此為調脈，故稱如經也。若反滑而數者，故知當屎膿也。"}], "method": "deterministic_markup_parse", "record_kind": "clause_with_collation_notes", "collation_notes": ["一作沉"]}
{"enrichment_id": "ENR_SHL_SONGBEN_AUX_0077", "clause_id": "SHL_SONGBEN_AUX_0077", "source_id": "SHSRC0035", "chapter": "平脈法第二", "base_sha256": "c433e58480a09f0d1a832fa4c459ebb744629135abaa8a06022f0897b5ed8573", "display_text": "寸口脈弱而緩，弱者陽氣不足，緩者胃氣有餘，噫而吞酸，食卒不下，氣填於膈上一作下也。", "segments": [{"t": "text", "s": "寸口脈弱而緩，弱者陽氣不足，緩者胃氣有餘，噫而吞酸，食卒不下，氣填於膈上"}, {"t": "note", "s": "一作下"}, {"t": "text", "s": "也。"}], "method": "deterministic_markup_parse", "record_kind": "clause_with_collation_notes", "collation_notes": ["一作下"]}
{"enrichment_id": "ENR_SHL_SONGBEN_AUX_0118", "clause_id": "SHL_SONGBEN_AUX_0118", "source_id": "SHSRC0035", "chapter": "傷寒例第三", "base_sha256": "94a69bdee89b7594930ff22b6541f1bd232fb1debda15605d0c59df344ed74c0", "display_text": "陽脈濡弱，陰脈弦緊者，更遇溫氣，變為溫疫一本作瘧。以此冬傷於寒，發為溫病，脈之變證，方治如說。", "segments": [{"t": "text", "s": "陽脈濡弱，陰脈弦緊者，更遇溫氣，變為溫疫"}, {"t": "note", "s": "一本作瘧"}, {"t": "text", "s": "。以此冬傷於寒，發為溫病，脈之變證，方治如說。"}], "method": "deterministic_markup_parse", "record_kind": "clause_with_collation_notes", "collation_notes": ["一本作瘧"]}
{"enrichment_id": "ENR_SHL_SONGBEN_AUX_0146", "clause_id": "SHL_SONGBEN_AUX_0146", "source_id": "SHSRC0035", "chapter": "辨痙濕暍脈證第四", "base_sha256": "fdfeb0441397e834cd8c6d283bc861d4749046acc0b9b637eea3a4f383cf0af7", "display_text": "太陽病，關節疼痛而煩，脈沉而細一作緩者，此名濕痹一云中濕。濕痹之候，其人小便不利，大便反快，但當利其小便。", "segments": [{"t": "text", "s": "太陽病，關節疼痛而煩，脈沉而細"}, {"t": "note", "s": "一作緩"}, {"t": "text", "s": "者，此名濕痹"}, {"t": "note", "s": "一云中濕"}, {"t": "text", "s": "。濕痹之候，其人小便不利，大便反快，但當利其小便。"}], "method": "deterministic_markup_parse", "record_kind": "clause_with_collation_notes", "collation_notes": ["一作緩", "一云中濕"]}
{"enrichment_id": "ENR_SHL_SONGBEN_AUX_0149", "clause_id": "SHL_SONGBEN_AUX_0149", "source_id": "SHSRC0035", "chapter": "辨痙濕暍脈證第四", "base_sha256": "a76f4b94f38db01500a05330075cae85e020a4f0d4c0ce04ad5845e9440cf535", "display_text": "濕家下之，額上汗出，微喘，小便利一云不利者死。若下利不止者，亦死。", "segments": [{"t": "text", "s": "濕家下之，額上汗出，微喘，小便利"}, {"t": "note", "s": "一云不利"}, {"t": "text", "s": "者死。若下利不止者，亦死。"}], "method": "deterministic_markup_parse", "record_kind": "clause_with_collation_notes", "collation_notes": ["一云不利"]}
